{
  "name": "门派闯关专用识别任务（v2 · 对应 GUI 配置）",
  "description": "对应截图1/2：MPCG_recognize 识别门派闯关任务，返回 target_location 字段；图像识别事件用动态模板路径找对应 NPC；点击传送。需玩家已接门派闯关任务并打开任务栏。",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "evt_recognize",
      "name": "函数调用3",
      "event_type": "function",
      "enabled": true,
      "pre_delay": 0,
      "post_delay": 0.5,
      "on_error": "retry",
      "max_retries": 3,
      "retry_interval": 1.0,
      "params": {
        "module": "MPCG",
        "function": "MPCG_recognize",
        "kwargs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "evt_click_npc",
      "name": "点击门派NPC",
      "event_type": "image",
      "enabled": true,
      "pre_delay": 0,
      "post_delay": 0.3,
      "on_error": "retry",
      "max_retries": 2,
      "retry_interval": 1.0,
      "params": {
        "template_source": "dynamic",
        "source_event": "函数调用3",
        "source_field": "target_location",
        "template_prefix": "会员传送3(",
        "template_suffix": ").bmp",
        "template_dir": "E:/DS/梦幻西游脚本函数包/图片数据",
        "action": "click",
        "threshold": 0.8,
        "region": null,
        "_comment_dynamic_path": "完整模板路径 = 模板目录 + 前缀 + 字段值 + 后缀 → E:/DS/梦幻西游脚本函数包/图片数据/会员传送3(天宫).bmp（target_location=天宫 时）",
        "_comment_missing": "⚠️ 这种按地图拆分的 NPC 模板当前未在图片数据目录存在，需先用截图工具采集每个门派地图的 NPC 图标并命名为 会员传送3(天宫).bmp 等"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "evt_branch",
      "name": "验证识别结果",
      "event_type": "condition",
      "enabled": true,
      "pre_delay": 0,
      "post_delay": 0,
      "on_error": "skip",
      "params": {
        "variable": "${函数调用3.target_location}",
        "operator": "!=",
        "value": "",
        "true_branch": [
          {
            "id": "log_success",
            "name": "识别成功-打日志",
            "event_type": "key",
            "params": {
              "keys": "ALT+E",
              "text": ""
            }
          }
        ],
        "false_branch": [
          {
            "id": "log_fail",
            "name": "识别失败-停止",
            "event_type": "key",
            "params": {
              "keys": "ESC",
              "text": ""
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}